    <node id="PERSISTENT COVID SYMPTOMS">
      <data key="d0">PERSISTENT COVID SYMPTOMS</data>
      <data key="d1">RESPIRATORY_INFECTION</data>
      <data key="d2">Review term for ongoing symptoms after COVID-19 infection; cognitive dysfunction is included among symptoms that may affect daily life. | Post-acute condition following COVID-19 infection, referenced in the citation as persistent long-COVID-19 symptoms. Although not an acute infection itself, it is retained under the respiratory-infection category because the valid type list has no separate post-infectious syndrome type.</data>
      <data key="d3">0.88</data>
      <data key="d4">4b18c63f-2f87-46c1-a3ae-8c4337490271_chunk_10,4b18c63f-2f87-46c1-a3ae-8c4337490271_chunk_11,4b18c63f-2f87-46c1-a3ae-8c4337490271_chunk_12,4b18c63f-2f87-46c1-a3ae-8c4337490271_chunk_38,4b18c63f-2f87-46c1-a3ae-8c4337490271_chunk_39</data>
