      <data key="d0">NEUROPSYCHIATRIC MANIFESTATIONS</data>
      <data key="d1">COGNITIVE_DOMAIN</data>
      <data key="d2">Neuropsychiatric symptoms or manifestations referenced in relation to long-COVID and recovered COVID-19 cohorts. | Broad neuropsychological outcome category mentioned as a long COVID manifestation potentially influenced by nosocomial gut pathogens; the passage does not specify a narrower cognitive domain or test. | Psychiatric and neurobehavioral outcomes reported in post-COVID-19 syndrome, potentially overlapping with cognitive complaints and psychological sequelae.</data>
