    <node id="STEM CELL-DERIVED EXOSOME THERAPEUTIC ACTIVITY">
      <data key="d0">STEM CELL-DERIVED EXOSOME THERAPEUTIC ACTIVITY</data>
      <data key="d1">BIOLOGICAL_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d2">The biological activity by which exosomes derived from stem cells are proposed to exert diverse therapeutic effects and serve as an alternative to stem cell-based therapy in surgical conditions. | The broad therapeutic activity attributed to exosomes derived from ESCs, iPSCs, HSCs, MSCs, NSCs, and EPCs as a cell-free alternative to stem cell therapy.</data>
