      <data key="d1">CONFOUNDING_FACTOR</data>
      <data key="d2">Latent variable in the model with two factors. Vaccination status is included as a participant-level factor that may influence COVID-19 severity and/or subsequent cognitive failure. | Factor associated with reduced risk of seven symptoms in the passage. It is included as a relevant covariate or modifier of long-COVID symptom risk, although no specific vaccine type, dose, or effect size is provided. | Vaccination is referenced as a contextual factor in an article title about COVID-19 transmission under school operating scenarios in the U.S. It may influence observed transmission patterns.</data>
