      <data key="d0">PERCENTAGE OF TOTAL FIXATIONS ON HAPPY STIMULI</data>
      <data key="d1">NEUROPSYCH_TEST</data>
      <data key="d2">Eye-tracking fixation metric used to quantify attention toward happy stimuli. | Eye-tracking outcome measuring the proportion of all fixations directed toward happy stimuli.</data>
