      <data key="d2">Neuropsychological task used to assess cognitive control; slower Stroop performance is cited as behavioral evidence of cognitive impairment in long COVID. | A neuropsychological task used in the study to induce and validate cognitive fatigue in healthy adults. | Attention-related task administered during EEG recording as one measure of attentional function.</data>
