      <data key="d2">Overall characterization of cognitive performance referenced in the study title 'Cognitive profile, neuroimaging and fluid biomarkers in post-acute COVID-19 syndrome.' | Broad cognitive outcome category referenced in studies of 1-year survivors of COVID-19-associated ARDS and in patients assessed 1 year after ICU admission. | Overall pattern of cognitive functioning in PACS patients with cognitive complaints. The excerpt does not specify individual domains or tests, but the study aims to define this profile and follow its longitudinal evolution.</data>
