      <data key="d0">MILD COGNITIVE IMPAIRMENT (MCI)</data>
      <data key="d1">DISEASE_SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d2">Described as a prodromal or early clinical stage of Alzheimer’s disease and related dementias, representing a window for early intervention.</data>
