      <data key="d1">DISEASE_SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d2">The severity-defined acquired brain injury population targeted by the randomized controlled trial: children aged 5–17 years with moderate-to-severe ABI. | Eligibility required children to have moderate to severe acquired brain injury, operationalized as a Glasgow Coma Scale score of 12 or lower at injury or onset.</data>
