    <node id="POSTOPERATIVE NEUROCOGNITIVE DYSFUNCTION">
      <data key="d0">POSTOPERATIVE NEUROCOGNITIVE DYSFUNCTION</data>
      <data key="d1">COGNITIVE_DOMAIN</data>
      <data key="d2">The primary neurocognitive outcome referenced in the study title; postoperative cognitive decline or dysfunction monitored in older adults after surgery. | Postoperative cognitive outcome characterized by objective decline across cognitive dimensions; the cohort showed a POCD incidence consistent with previous reports in similar perioperative cohorts.</data>
