    <node id="P300 COMPONENT">
      <data key="d0">P300 COMPONENT</data>
      <data key="d1">BIOLOGICAL_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d2">An event-related potential component evoked by low-probability stimuli. It includes P3a and P3b waves and is discussed as an electrophysiological correlate relevant to motor learning and decision-related processing. | A subcomponent of the P300 event-related potential referenced in the integrative theory of P3a and P3b.</data>
      <data key="d3">0.9</data>
