    <node id="GLIAL FIBRILLARY ACIDIC PROTEIN (GFAP)">
      <data key="d0">GLIAL FIBRILLARY ACIDIC PROTEIN (GFAP)</data>
      <data key="d1">BIOLOGICAL_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d2">Serum biomarker of astroglial activation or injury measured longitudinally using single molecule array technology. | Serum biomarker reflecting astroglial injury. COVID-19 patients with cognitive failure had higher sGFAP levels than those without cognitive failure, and levels decreased at follow-up.</data>
