      <data key="d0">INSOMNIA SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d1">DISEASE_SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d2">The degree of insomnia symptoms or clinical burden, assessed using the Insomnia Severity Index. | Severity of insomnia symptoms included as a predictor in the structural equation model. | Severity of insomnia symptoms in carceral settings; CBT-I-based approaches were associated with clinically meaningful reductions in uncontrolled evaluations.</data>
