      <data key="d1">DISEASE_SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d2">Hospital-treated infections identified before the 2018 HCAP cognitive assessment using national inpatient records from 1997 to 2018. These infections represent clinically severe infection episodes and were associated with poorer cognitive performance at HCAP. | Incident hospital-treated viral infections occurring during post-HCAP follow-up. Executive function was the cognitive domain most strongly associated with reduced risk of these infections.</data>
