 drift diffusion model parameters and described as potentially capturable through passive naturalistic smartphone typing data as well as standard neuropsychological tests. | Cognitive domain referenced in the title 'Improved sleep quality is independently associated with decision-making recovery in panic disorder.' It represents an executive cognitive process involved in choosing between alternatives and adapting behavior.</data>
