    <node id="VISUOCONSTRUCTIVE DEFICIT">
      <data key="d0">VISUOCONSTRUCTIVE DEFICIT</data>
      <data key="d1">COGNITIVE_DOMAIN</data>
      <data key="d2">Specific impairment in visuoconstructional ability detected in approximately one-quarter of mild COVID-19 individuals and associated with brain imaging changes and peripheral immune marker upregulation. | Specific cognitive impairment detected in a subset of mild COVID-19 individuals; associated with molecular and structural brain imaging changes and peripheral immune marker upregulation. | A deficit in visuoconstructional or visuoconstructive ability. In the text, individuals with this cognitive deficit showed differential upregulation of plasma biomarkers, and biomarker levels were compared with the presence of the deficit.</data>
      <data key="d3">0.98</data>
