    <node id="NEUROFILAMENT LIGHT CHAIN">
      <data key="d0">NEUROFILAMENT LIGHT CHAIN</data>
      <data key="d1">BIOLOGICAL_MECHANISM</data>
      <data key="d2">A proposed cross-disease biomarker of neuronal degeneration used to investigate CNS damage associated with SARS-CoV-2 infection. | A blood biomarker associated with neuronal injury and longitudinal neurodegeneration in Alzheimer disease. | Plasma neurofilament light chain, abbreviated NfL, was used as a biomarker of neural injury and neurodegeneration. PSEN-1 E280A mutation carriers showed higher NfL levels than non-carriers.</data>
