    <node id="VISUOSPATIAL PERCEPTION">
      <data key="d0">VISUOSPATIAL PERCEPTION</data>
      <data key="d1">COGNITIVE_DOMAIN</data>
      <data key="d2">Cognitive domain involving perception and organization of visual-spatial information, directly relevant to copying a complex figure. | Cognitive domain referenced in the title 'Visuospatial perception: an emerging biomarker for Alzheimer’s disease.' It concerns perception and interpretation of visual-spatial information. | Perceptual cognitive domain mentioned in a cited study title on children and adolescents with brain tumor. | Cognitive domain assessed by the Benton Judgment of Line Orientation test. | A sensory-perceptual domain in which anticipatory attention has been demonstrated.</data>
      <data key="d3">0.78</data>
