      <data key="d1">DISEASE_SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d2">Disease-severity context from one cited study describing individuals with mild symptomatic SARS-CoV-2 infection who were evaluated for subsequent cognitive decline. | Severity category from cited prior work describing individuals with a history of mild symptomatic SARS-CoV-2 infection who experienced cognitive decline. | Infection category in which participants had documented SARS-CoV-2 infection without symptomatic COVID-19; included together with mild COVID-19 cases. | SARS-CoV-2 infection without symptoms. The abstract states that asymptomatic infection was not associated with adverse outcomes, distinguishing it from symptomatic infection.</data>
