      <data key="d8">INSOMNIA</data>
      <data key="d9">CONFOUNDED_BY</data>
      <data key="d10">Insomnia may directly cause or exacerbate difficulty concentrating, meaning it can partly explain concentration difficulties observed among long COVID symptoms. | Concentration difficulties showed a similar pattern of change over time to insomnia. | Insomnia may impair concentration independently, making it a plausible confounder of attention-related cognitive symptoms.</data>
