      <data key="d8">SYMPTOMATIC INFECTIONS</data>
      <data key="d9">VARIES_WITH_SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d10">The study reports that long-term sequelae are specific to symptomatic infections; concentration difficulties are included among the reported sequelae.</data>
