      <data key="d8">MILD SARS-COV-2 INFECTION</data>
      <data key="d9">VARIES_WITH_SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d10">Persistent symptoms can occur following mild SARS-CoV-2 infection, indicating that long-term complaints such as concentration difficulties are not restricted to hospitalised severe disease, although the mild-infection estimate is not specific to concentration.</data>
