      <data key="d8">SIX-MONTH PERIOD</data>
      <data key="d9">OBSERVED_AT</data>
      <data key="d10">Slight cognitive improvements were observed during the longitudinal study period in which repeated testing occurred across six months.</data>
      <data key="d11">0.76</data>
