      <data key="d8">CHRONIC FATIGUE</data>
      <data key="d9">CONFOUNDED_BY</data>
      <data key="d10">Ongoing fatigue is identified as a plausible factor limiting improvement in well-being despite slight gains in cognitive performance.</data>
