      <data key="d8">POST-TRAUMATIC STRESS DISORDER</data>
      <data key="d9">CONFOUNDED_BY</data>
      <data key="d10">PTSD after severe COVID-19 may affect concentration, attention, sleep, and memory, potentially confounding observed post-COVID cognitive dysfunction. | PTSD is documented in survivors of severe COVID-19 infections and may affect cognitive symptoms or test performance, making it relevant as a potential confounder in post-COVID cognitive-outcome interpretation.</data>
      <data key="d11">0.68</data>
      <data key="d12">2</data>
      <data key="d13">63b31c15-b9bb-4a8e-a6dd-082b7c1908fa_chunk_5</data>
      <data key="d14">63b31c15-b9bb-4a8e-a6dd-082b7c1908fa</data>
