      <data key="d8">SEVERE COVID-19 INFECTION</data>
      <data key="d9">VARIES_WITH_SEVERITY</data>
      <data key="d10">The cited literature includes severe COVID-19 survivor cohorts, supporting consideration of whether cognitive outcomes differ by illness severity.</data>
      <data key="d11">0.68</data>
