      <data key="d9">OBSERVED_AT</data>
      <data key="d10">Six-month outcome assessment in ICU-treated COVID-19 cohorts provides a plausible timepoint for observing post-acute cognitive and related functional outcomes, though the cited title does not isolate cognition specifically.</data>
      <data key="d11">0.62</data>
      <data key="d12">2</data>
      <data key="d13">63b31c15-b9bb-4a8e-a6dd-082b7c1908fa_chunk_5</data>
