      <data key="d9">CONFOUNDED_BY</data>
      <data key="d10">Comorbidities may confound observed cognitive functioning after ICU treatment by contributing to cognitive outcomes independently of COVID-19 status. | Comorbidities may independently contribute to cognitive decline in pulmonary patients and complicate attribution of cognitive dysfunction to COVID-19.</data>
