      <data key="d9">COMPARED_TO</data>
      <data key="d10">Bland et al. 2024 profiles both objective and subjective cognitive function, allowing comparison between performance-based cognition and self-reported cognitive experience. | A related article title compares profiles of objective and subjective cognitive function in Post-COVID Syndrome, COVID-19 recovered, and COVID-19 naïve individuals. | The ICU survivor study specifically reports a lack of clinically relevant correlation between subjective and objective cognitive function.</data>
