      <data key="d8">12-MONTH FOLLOW-UP</data>
      <data key="d9">OBSERVED_AT</data>
      <data key="d10">Subjective cognitive function was assessed during a prospective 12-month follow-up of ICU survivors. | Objective cognitive function was assessed during the same prospective 12-month follow-up period.</data>
      <data key="d11">0.8</data>
      <data key="d12">1</data>
      <data key="d13">b24179f1-ebda-47e4-9ae7-42c367d15e44_chunk_51</data>
