      <data key="d8">LONELINESS</data>
      <data key="d9">CONFOUNDED_BY</data>
      <data key="d10">Loneliness may influence perceived cognitive functioning during the pandemic and therefore confound interpretation of subjective cognitive outcomes.</data>
      <data key="d11">0.72</data>
