      <data key="d8">T2, JUNE–JULY 2020</data>
      <data key="d9">OBSERVED_AT</data>
      <data key="d10">Subjective cognitive functioning was assessed at the second survey wave when restrictions and daily cases were relatively low. | The CFQ and general subjective cognitive questions were administered during the T2 assessment wave.</data>
      <data key="d11">0.84</data>
