      <data key="d9">MEASURED_BY</data>
      <data key="d10">Sustained attention was measured using the AX-CPT, with higher accuracy interpreted as enhanced sustained attention. | The AX-CPT is explicitly described as a lower cognitive-demanding task used to measure sustained attention. | AX-CPT measures sustained attention because participants must monitor a long sequence of letter-pair trials and respond only to the correct AX target sequence.</data>
