      <data key="d9">CONFOUNDED_BY</data>
      <data key="d10">Sustained attention performance varied according to chronotype, with early and late chronotypes showing improved accuracy at preferred times and late chronotypes showing additional reaction-time and P300 effects. | Chronotype significantly interacted with daytime to influence AX-CPT accuracy and reaction time, indicating that sustained-attention performance depends on circadian preference.</data>
